WEBVTT

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.890
Team Caesar...

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.300
Let's all fight to the best of our abilities!

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.190
I'll do my best!

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.520
I warn you, I'm not gonna hold back!

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:27.090
Looking forward to it, rival.

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:29.910
This looks like it's gonna 
be a fun fight, huh?

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:31.610
Uh huh!

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:09.990
"Looking forward to it, rival!"

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:11.200
I mean...

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:14.070
Even though they were a champion 
team, they don't put on airs,

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:16.060
or look down on us...

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:17.570
They're good people.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.900
It's like they're adults, ya know?

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:21.640
Others should learn by their example,

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.470
including someone on our team...

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.990
Certainly, it would be beneficial for you to 
follow their example and settle down a bit.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.200
Well, I knew it wouldn't get through to him.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:38.180
It's the second fight of the semifinals! 
Team Q4 against Team Caesar!

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:41.350
First up is Kamui Katsuragi from Team Q4...

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:42.620
You're on.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:45.710
Yeah! Here I go!

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:50.830
Gladiator

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:54.540
...versus Gai Usui from Team Caeser!

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:57.050
All right.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:00.890
Do you have a good image 
of how you're going to win?

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.180
I'm not a kid anymore, Sis.

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:09.580
I, Team Caesar's Gladiator, will 
surely protect his Imperial Majesty.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:20.210
I don't know... When it comes to the 
crunch, he often makes a fatal mistake.

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:24.080
Okay, okay... But if you harp on it, 
people aren't gonna like you, Yuri.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:27.510
Are you saying that I'm 
a noisy, shrewish ogre?

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.550
No, I didn't go that far...

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:35.250
I've been waiting for you, Gladiator!

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:37.260
Team Caesar!

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:39.270
Caeser

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:39.300
Protect the Emperor!

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:42.260
Oh, boy! Listen to those cheers!

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:47.480
It's because they were the runner-up at the 
previous tournament, and Team AL4's rival.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:56.070
Sounds like they have an overwhelming 
lead when it comes to popularity, huh?

00:03:56.070 --> 00:04:00.240
Is he gonna be okay? I hope he 
doesn't cave under the pressure...

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:02.810
Kamui the Great! Don't let it bother you!

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:04.130
DB, yo!

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:07.590
Uh oh! After all this, now I'm nervous!

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:16.790
But being able to fight a strong guy like him 
in an awesome place like this is my big chance!

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.470
I'm gonna hit him with everything I've got!

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:20.840
Here I go, Gai!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.380
I'm ready, Kamui.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:27.700
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:41.220
The much-anticipated first round has begun!

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:45.040
What kind of fight will Team Caesar show us?

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:47.530
I'm sure AL4 is dying to find out, too!

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.350
Ren?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.720
Wake me up when it's Aichi's turn.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:55.740
Understood.

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:06.470
Good luck, Kamui.

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:30.570
This heated fight rages on!

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:35.600
Gai and Kamui are both strong and fired up!

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.440
All right, the score is tied!

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:52.200
They've both got 4 damage!

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:58.970
I'm pulling out all the stops here, but 
I can't see the opening that I need!

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:01.520
This is the national 
tournament top class level!

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.810
I stand and draw.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:07.500
I call Cosmo Beak.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:09.370
Counterblast.

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:13.060
I add +4000 to the power 
of my Vanguard, Daiyusha!

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:20.770
As it now has 14000 power, 
it gains an extra critical, too.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:23.320
Then I call Cosmo Roar!

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:29.670
With a boost from Cosmo Roar,

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:32.020
Daiyusha attacks Top Gun!

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:35.880
No guard!

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.560
Damage check!

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:44.330
With a boost from Diamond Ace,

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.960
Daiyusha attacks!

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:56.480
Feel the power that's been gathered by the 
strongest sword of the Dimension Police!

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:05.980
Kamui!

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:07.600
Kamui the Great!

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:09.800
Is this gonna decide it?!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.810
I guard with Twin Blader!

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:18.080
I drop one card from my hand for perfect defense!

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:24.730
First check!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.350
I got a critical trigger!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:32.010
I give +5000 power and the 
extra critical to Cosmo Beak.

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:36.600
Second check!

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:40.410
He got another critical trigger?

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:45.210
I give all the effects to Cosmo Beak!

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:53.420
With a boost from Cosmo 
Roar, Cosmo Beak attacks!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.290
I guard with Clara and Prometheus!

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:09.930
That's the end of my turn.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:16.590
Kamui is doing great!

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:22.140
What a surprise! Kamui survived 
that ferocious attack!

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.090
Indeed, he managed to h-<i>o</i>-ld out!

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:29.720
Even Daiyusha with an activated skill and 
Cosmo Beak with 2 criticals didn't touch him!

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.090
That's why he's called Kamui the Great!

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:35.380
Kind of like having the strongest shield 
to protect against the strongest sword?

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:40.120
Holding out against that stockpile of triggers... 
Not bad for the little brat!

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:43.480
All right! I'll make you one of 
my disciples if you want!

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.270
Over Kamui's dead body.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:46.340
OK, yo!

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:48.400
Which one?

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:49.340
I said...

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.030
O...

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:52.000
K...

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:53.410
yo.

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:55.330
I see...

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:57.300
I don't!

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.530
Wow... This is awesome!

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:03.790
Yeah. A good match!

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:06.520
I stand and draw!

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:09.820
I call Tough Boy!

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:16.080
With a boost from Tough Boy,

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:18.560
Death Metal attacks Daiyusha!

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:22.850
I activate Death Metal's skill!

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:25.640
I pay the cost and it gains +3000 power!

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:29.820
I activate Top Gun's skill!

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:33.450
This unit gets +1000 power for 
each rear-guard unit at rest!

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.250
That's a 2000 total increase!

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:51.330
With a boost from Death Army Guy,

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.820
Death Army Lady attacks!

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.610
I guard with Justice Cobalt!

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:11.610
It's not going through.

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:21.860
It's heating up here, Gai!

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:34.680
Here I go, Gai!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:35.880
I'm ready!

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:37.750
I attack with Top Gun!

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:43.590
Right now, the power of Kamui's Top Gun is...

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:45.110
...14000!

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:49.750
I guard with Justice Cobalt!

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:53.000
This is Gai's guard at full strength!

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:04.290
Then I'll surpass it!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:05.470
Twin Drive!

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:07.170
First check!

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.990
Death Metal stands!

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:13.600
And then receives +5000 power!

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:16.590
Second check!

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:19.310
Got one! Grade 3.

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:22.920
By activating its skill, both Death 
Army Guy and Lady stand!

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:27.070
I attack with Death Metal!

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:35.410
It's over...

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:54.960
The winner is Kamui Katsuragi of Team Q4!

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:59.070
That's the game!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:04.510
Kamui Katsuragi won the first round 
against the former runner-up team!

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.770
A great victory!

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:10.230
Yes!!

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:15.230
Where was the power to defeat a gladiator 
concealed within that small body?

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:16.860
That was s-<i>o</i> exciting, wasn't it?!

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:17.640
It sure was!

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:21.800
Congratulations, Kamui. You walloped me.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:23.760
Gai...

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:28.210
I'm proud to have you as my rival.

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:30.010
Well...

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:34.490
Thank you!

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:37.310
Great job, little brat!

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:38.680
It was wonderful!

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:41.430
GJLB, yo!

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:47.530
I'm sorry, Your Majesty.

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:50.020
It was a good fight, Gai.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:51.480
Thank you.

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:53.850
I want a word with you, boy...

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:56.250
S-Sis!

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:03.780
How many times did I ask if you 
had grasped the image of victory?

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:06.050
I-I know, but...

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:09.920
Where in the world are your ears attached?!

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:16.050
Help me, Koutei!

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:19.400
Wh-why are you using an emperor as a guard...?

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:26.730
That was fantastic, Kamui!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:28.790
I'm glad I won...

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:33.070
...but I'm especially happy that 
Caesar and Gai are our rivals!

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:37.150
They're good rivals. And will help you 
along in your future developments.

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:38.790
I'll bet you're thankful that you met them, huh?

00:13:39.030 --> 00:13:42.940
Gai is an adult <i>and</i> a cool rival!

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:45.560
Kamui looks really happy!

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:49.400
That's because he wrestled victory 
away from the previous runner-up team!

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:51.470
Um... WV, yo!

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:55.040
Hey, something interesting 
is happening over there.

00:13:57.680 --> 00:14:00.350
He's really getting a tongue-lashing!

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:03.790
"How pathetic, to lose against 
a little brat like that!

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:06.450
You always screw up at the critical moment!

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:10.830
You're totally useless! You're 
bringing down the team!"

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:11.830
He's crying...

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:17.580
Next up is the second match, 
with Misaki Tokura of Team Q4...

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:24.610
...versus Yuri Usui of Team Caesar!

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:27.790
Good luck, Misaki!

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:34.760
Oh, here it comes! I've been 
looking forward to this fight!

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:35.480
Why?

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:38.440
Why?! Those two would make a perfect picture!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:42.630
Unlike a rough fight between two guys, 
it'll be a magnificent girl power showdown!

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:44.410
Girl power?

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:51.400
Um, let's see... It's a thing that radiates 
female beauty, glamor, and class from the inside...

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:52.420
From the inside?

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.560
Ah, forget it.

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:59.620
You won't get anywhere talking to him about 
stuff like that, unless it relates to Kourin.

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:14.870
Well, well. It looks like there's a white 
rose and a red rose blooming on the field!

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:17.680
I bet we can c-<i>o</i>-unt on a colorful fight!

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.300
I t-<i>o</i>-tally agree.

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:21.290
Well, it's about to start!

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:24.140
Let the second match begin!

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:44.390
Show me what you've got.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:47.150
Come on, attack me with your best shot!

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.170
Yuri?

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:58.250
The Empress is scary when 
it comes to a serious fight.

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:00.430
Not only during fights...

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.760
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:20.260
I'll go first.

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:24.070
I activate Godhawk, Ichibyoshi's skill.

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:26.010
I get to look at the top 
five cards of my deck,

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:30.630
and if one of them is Goddess of the 
Crescent Moon, Tsukuyomi, I can superior ride!

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:35.590
It's not there.

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:37.250
She's off to a bad start.

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:39.910
I ride Dark Cat!

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.380
I activate Dark Cat's skill.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:50.950
When this unit appears, both 
players can draw a card.

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:57.150
That's the end of my turn.

00:16:57.760 --> 00:16:59.070
It's my turn.

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:02.220
I ride Enigman Ripple!

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:10.280
If Enigman Flow is in the Soul,

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:12.360
Enigman Ripple receives +2000 power!

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:16.030
I activate Enigman Flow's skill!

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:19.640
I can take one Enigman Wave from 
my deck and add it to my hand.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:32.050
I call Magical Police, Quilt!

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:34.200
And then, with a boost from Quilt...

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:39.400
...Enigman Ripple attacks Dark Cat!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:43.220
Drive trigger check!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.830
Damage check.

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:54.240
When an attack boosted by Magical Police 
Quilt hits, her skill is activated.

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:57.200
I drop one card and add one to my hand.

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.690
Sorry. That's the end of my turn.

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:02.210
So, you're up next.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:09.090
So Quilt is a card that lets you switch a card from 
your hand if the boosted attack hits...

00:18:09.090 --> 00:18:11.000
Then next time, she should 
guard against it, right?

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:14.750
No, she can't afford to carelessly reduce 
the number of cards in her hand either...

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:19.170
What's the difference? It doesn't 
matter unless she draws a grade 3.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:23.090
Lose-umi is operating normally today.

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:24.990
LONT, yo...

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:27.640
I stand and draw.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:32.410
I ride Goddess of the Half Moon, Tsukuyomi!

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:38.590
There's no Crescent Moon in the Soul.

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:42.200
True, I can't activate her skill. But...

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:45.400
...I call Battle Maiden, Tagitsuhime!

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:53.230
I attack with Goddess of 
the Half Moon, Tsukuyomi!

00:18:58.980 --> 00:18:59.930
No guard.

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:02.230
Drive trigger check.

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:08.320
Damage check.

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:11.400
I attack with Tagitsuhime!

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:19.890
Damage check.

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:23.090
That's the end of my turn.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.840
You're better than my little brother.

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:37.280
Th-This has mowed down the image of the 
glamorous conflict we were predicting,

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:39.520
and is turning into a fierce catfight!

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:43.820
Indeed. I'm not seeing beautiful, 
fluttering flower petals,

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:48.700
but sharp, glittering th-<i>o</i>-rns!

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:56.120
Y-Yuri doesn't fit the image I had of her...

00:19:56.120 --> 00:20:00.250
I guess she's the type to get 
passionate during an actual fight.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:04.440
A-Although Misaki is just 
as fired up as Yuri...

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:07.980
Look closely. That's girl power!

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:10.570
W-W-W-Wait a second! That's not right!

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:12.130
<i>That's</i> not girl power!

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:14.930
Girl power! What a terrifying power!

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.370
I believed...

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.450
Girl power is scary!

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.050
GPS, yo!

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:39.180
There's no stopping her 
when she gets like that...

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:42.900
But if Yuri is <i>this</i> serious...

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:46.420
...I guess that shows how 
strong her opponent is.

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:49.820
That's Team Q4 for you... our rival!

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:52.240
I stand and draw!

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.880
I ride Enigman Wave!

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:05.640
If Enigman Ripple is in the Soul, 
Enigman Wave receives +1000 power!

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.950
I call two units of Super 
Dimensional Robo, Dailady

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.600
and Cosmo Roar!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.540
Now the <i>real</i> game starts...

00:21:43.670 --> 00:21:44.820
Misaki...

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:49.410
Yuri Usui of Team Caesar!

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:52.650
As she leads her units to victory,

00:21:52.650 --> 00:21:56.660
she's known as the noble and strong Empress!

00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:06.290
Prepare yourself!

00:23:51.500 --> 00:23:54.610
All right! I beat Gai!

00:23:54.610 --> 00:23:56.940
He said, "Looking forward to it, rival!"

00:23:56.940 --> 00:23:58.670
Woo-hoo! I'm touched!

00:23:59.230 --> 00:24:00.870
Misaki's in trouble!

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.070
Her opponent is the noble Empress...

00:24:03.070 --> 00:24:04.670
Good luck, Misaki!

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:07.480
Wow... Their fighting styles 
are totally opposite!

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:09.710
Next time: Caesar's Empress.

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:13.620
Misaki! Strong feelings draw 
in the image of victory!

00:24:13.620 --> 00:24:15.280
Don't lose to Yuri's spirit!

